### RiseUP APIs - Test Suite (v2.0)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5001
### Updated for new routes architecture with health checks and shorter endpoints

### Variables (Update these with actual usernames for testing)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@leetcodeUser = mukrramkhan37
@githubUser = example_user
@gfgUser = mohammad_mokaram_khan
@codeforcesUser = mukrramkhan37
@codechefUser = mukrramkhan37
@hackerrankUser = mukrramkhan37

###############################################################################
# 0. HEALTH & STATUS ENDPOINTS - NEW!
###############################################################################

### Get API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Basic Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Detailed Server Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/status
Accept: application/json

###

### List All Supported Platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/platforms
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
# 1. COMBINED ENDPOINTS - Fetch from multiple platforms
###############################################################################

### Fetch All Platforms Data (Aggregate Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{leetcodeUser}}"
}

###

### Fetch All Platforms with Different Usernames
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platformUsernames": {
    "leetcode": "{{leetcodeUser}}",
    "github": "{{githubUser}}",
    "codeforces": "{{codeforcesUser}}",
    "codechef": "{{codechefUser}}",
    "hackerrank": "{{hackerrankUser}}",
    "geeksforgeeks": "{{gfgUser}}"
  }
}

###

### Test Aggregate Endpoint with Missing Username (Error Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

